.TH INCIDENTSNAP 1
.SH NAME
incidentsnap \- capture a read-only host and boot-context snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B incidentsnap
[--format json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Emits host identity, operating-system release, kernel, boot identifier, and
uptime evidence when available. It performs no collection beyond these local
read-only sources and is not a complete forensic acquisition.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --format json
Emit the versioned JSON report (the only supported format).
.SH EXIT STATUS
2 means invalid usage; 3 means the bounded snapshot was collected with possible
missing sources; and 4 means output failed.
